msgid "ReliefOS 5.3.2"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.3.2"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"重写离线系统更新流程，使用独立 APK 数据库和信任密钥预检目标系统、更新介质与空间；保留未涉及的软件包和配置，并迁移旧 world "
"请求中的历史包装包。更新事务会移除已退役的过渡包，同时保留被标记的软件包。"
msgstr ""
"Rewrote offline system updates to precheck target systems, update media, and space using a "
"separate APK database/trusted keys. Unaffected packages/configuration are preserved, and "
"historical wrapper requests in old world files are migrated. Update transactions remove retired "
"transition packages while retaining marked packages."

msgid ""
"支持多系统共用 EFI System Partition。每个 ReliefOS 根分区使用 PARTUUID 隔离引导配置、内核槽位和版本状态；安装器默认保留已有 ESP "
"内容，更新器核对根分区与 ESP 的归属，未知 EFI 文件不会被覆盖。预制磁盘镜像可使用不同实例标识，避免并接时共享 GPT 身份。"
msgstr ""
"Multiple systems may share an EFI System Partition. Each ReliefOS root uses PARTUUID-isolated boot"
" configuration, kernel slots, and version state. Installer defaults preserve ESP contents; the "
"updater checks root/ESP ownership and does not overwrite unknown EFI files. Prebuilt disk images "
"may use distinct instance identifiers to avoid shared GPT identities when attached together."

msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer 新增 MP4 软件解码和画面显示，使用锁定的 LGPL FFmpeg 8.1.3 精简共享库，支持 H.264、MPEG-4 Part 2、HEVC 视频及 "
"AAC、MP3 音轨。音画按设备播放进度同步。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer adds MP4 software decoding/display through pinned reduced LGPL FFmpeg 8.1.3 shared "
"libraries, supporting H.264, MPEG-4 Part 2, and HEVC video with AAC/MP3 audio. Audio/video "
"synchronize to device playback progress."

msgid ""
"将 sl、ncurses、zlib、libpng、SQLite 和 mbedTLS 3 从六个源码子模块迁移到带上游签名的 Alpine v3.24 APK。运行库、SDK、许可证与 APK "
"所有权记录按锁定版本构建；RPR 构建流程保留完整签名索引及上游 APK，不再生成这六项本地包装包或旧过渡包。"
msgstr ""
"Migrated sl, ncurses, zlib, libpng, SQLite, and mbedTLS 3 from six source submodules to upstream-"
"signed Alpine v3.24 APKs. Runtimes, SDK, licenses, and APK ownership records use locked versions. "
"RPR builds retain complete signed indexes/upstream APKs, no longer generating six local wrappers "
"or old transition packages."

msgid "桌面应用采用 XDG 用户目录和标准快捷键。系统移除早期产品激活流程、旧许可证接口及对应配置。"
msgstr ""
"Desktop applications adopt XDG user directories and standard shortcuts. Removed early product "
"activation, old license interfaces, and associated configuration."

msgid "安装器语言选择后显示完整 Apache License 2.0 英文原文，替代旧的感谢页。"
msgstr ""
"After language selection, the installer displays the complete original English Apache License 2.0 "
"instead of the old acknowledgments page."

msgid "文档发布工作流在构建 GitHub Pages 前分别严格验证 ReliefOS 与 ReliefNT 手册；修正若干依赖和 GNU Unifont 的下载来源。"
msgstr ""
"The documentation publishing workflow strictly validates the ReliefOS and ReliefNT manuals "
"separately before building GitHub Pages. Fixed several dependency and GNU Unifont download "
"sources."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**是。** 早期私有产品激活接口及状态不再提供；依赖 ``include/reliefos/license.h``、激活符号或旧激活配置的程序需要移除调用并重新构建。SQLite 已改用标准 "
"``libsqlite3.so.0``，旧 ``sqlite.so.3``、自定义 VFS 和扩展库偶然导出的厂商内部符号均不再兼容；依赖这些实现细节的程序需要迁移到标准 SQLite "
"接口，并使用本版 SDK 重新链接。未改变标准 Linux syscall 编号或磁盘文件系统格式。"
msgstr ""
"**Yes.** Early private product-activation interfaces/state are removed. Programs using "
"``include/reliefos/license.h``, activation symbols, or old activation settings must remove calls "
"and rebuild. SQLite now uses standard ``libsqlite3.so.0``; old ``sqlite.so.3``, custom VFS, and "
"accidentally exported vendor-internal symbols are incompatible. Dependent programs must migrate to"
" standard SQLite APIs and relink with this SDK. Standard Linux syscall numbers and on-disk "
"filesystem formats are unchanged."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**源码 Release**，只提供标签和 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译 ISO、磁盘镜像、安装器、SDK 或 "
"APK。构建前递归初始化标签固定的子模块；普通构建使用已锁定的本地依赖缓存，需要补齐缓存时执行 ``make fetch``。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **source release** with only tags and GitHub automatic archives, without prebuilt ISO, "
"disk images, installer, SDK, or APK. Recursively initialize tag-pinned submodules before building."
" Normal builds use locked local dependency caches; run ``make fetch`` to fill missing caches."

msgid ""
"离线更新会将旧包装包的 world 请求映射到官方包、保留其他包和配置，并在正式更新事务中卸载旧包装包。上游 APK 的版本、签名和摘要由依赖锁固定；生成本地 RPR "
"发布树不表示已部署到外部服务，本次 Release 也不发布二进制 RPR。"
msgstr ""
"Offline updates map old wrapper world requests to official packages, preserve other "
"packages/configuration, and uninstall old wrappers in the actual update transaction. Locks pin "
"upstream APK versions, signatures, and digests. Generating a local RPR tree does not deploy it "
"externally; this Release publishes no binary RPR."

msgid ""
"多系统安装请使用手动分区并为 ReliefOS 指定独立根分区。只有明确选择格式化 ESP 才会清除其中内容；预制磁盘的逐字节副本仍具有相同 GPT 身份，同时连接前应使用不同 "
"``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID`` 重建。"
msgstr ""
"For multi-system installs, use manual partitioning with a separate ReliefOS root. ESP contents are"
" erased only when formatting is explicitly selected. Byte-for-byte disk copies retain identical "
"GPT identities; rebuild with different ``IMAGE_INSTANCE_ID`` values before attaching together."

msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer 使用软件解码，最高源分辨率为 4096 × 2160，显示快照上限为 1280 × 720；没有硬件加速、HDR "
"色调映射、字幕或多音轨选择。高分辨率视频的流畅程度取决于虚拟机性能。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer uses software decoding, with source resolution up to 4096 × 2160 and display "
"snapshots up to 1280 × 720. It has no hardware acceleration, HDR tone mapping, subtitles, or "
"multi-audio-track selection. High-resolution smoothness depends on VM performance."

msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer 的目标端媒体探针通过，链接锁定 FFmpeg 8.1.3 musl 库，覆盖 "
"H.264/AAC、HEVC、MPEG-4、旋转画面、静音视频、定位、播放控制和损坏/不支持的媒体；RPR 包命名、双公钥信任和发布校验测试通过。宿主端媒体测试未通过构建：宿主只有 FFmpeg "
"4.4.2 头文件，缺少本实现使用的 ``AVChannelLayout`` API；目标端结果不代表宿主测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer target media probes passed against pinned FFmpeg 8.1.3 musl libraries, covering "
"H.264/AAC, HEVC, MPEG-4, rotated frames, silent video, seeking, playback controls, and "
"corrupt/unsupported media. RPR package naming, dual-public-key trust, and publication-validation "
"tests passed. Host media tests failed to build: the host has only FFmpeg 4.4.2 headers, lacking "
"the implementation's ``AVChannelLayout`` API. Target results do not establish host-test success."

msgid ""
"发行验证覆盖版本生成、主仓 ``VERSION_ID``、文档和定向构建检查。完整主仓 ``make test`` 的音频包、认证 staging、UEFI 安装布局和 bootstrap "
"检查通过；随后在 ``test-brand-identity.sh`` 停止，共有 32 条既有失败（一条 GRUB 安装器文案断言和 31 条旧名称 allowlist "
"断言），之后的构建测试未执行。发行过程没有修改 ABI golden 或绕过该检查。VMware、物理硬件和从头到尾的真实磁盘安装流程未完成本版验收，历史单项 QEMU 结果不等于整版复验。"
msgstr ""
"Release validation covers version generation, repository ``VERSION_ID``, documentation, and "
"targeted builds. Full repository ``make test`` passed audio-package, authentication-staging, UEFI "
"installation-layout, and bootstrap checks, then stopped at ``test-brand-identity.sh`` with 32 "
"existing failures: one GRUB-installer text assertion and 31 old-name allowlist assertions. Later "
"build tests did not run. The release did not modify ABI golden data or bypass this check. VMware, "
"physical hardware, and end-to-end real-disk installation have not completed acceptance for this "
"release; historical individual QEMU results are not full-release retests."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"版本由 ``configs/build-version`` 确定为 **5.3.2**；ReliefOS 生成数字字段为 **5/3/2**，``/etc/os-release`` 的 "
"``VERSION_ID`` 为 **5.3.2**。内核版本、模块 ABI 和 gitlink 均由 ReliefNT v5.3.2 单独固定。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/build-version`` sets version **5.3.2**. ReliefOS generates numeric fields **5/3/2**; "
"``VERSION_ID`` in ``/etc/os-release`` is **5.3.2**. ReliefNT v5.3.2 separately pins the kernel "
"version, module ABI, and gitlink."

msgid ""
"MP4 运行库使用 FFmpeg LGPL 配置及独立 ``-reliefplayer`` SONAME；启用播放器时由 ``reliefos-media-codecs`` 包携带运行库和 "
"LGPL 原文。SDK 与来宾运行时 APK 分开暂存，不能用宿主库替代目标库。"
msgstr ""
"MP4 runtimes use FFmpeg's LGPL configuration and separate ``-reliefplayer`` SONAMEs. When the "
"player is enabled, ``reliefos-media-codecs`` carries runtimes and original LGPL text. SDK and "
"guest runtime APKs are staged separately; host libraries cannot replace target libraries."

msgid ""
"本次范围为 ReliefOS v5.3.1 提交 **2f75f3040c9a3c1838b273124ed685941b3686f0** 之后至 v5.3.2 "
"标签指向的版本提交；仅汇总主仓最终生效内容，排除 ReliefNT 实现、纯合并和纯 gitlink 更新。下一版以该版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"The range runs after ReliefOS v5.3.1 commit **2f75f3040c9a3c1838b273124ed685941b3686f0** through "
"the version commit referenced by v5.3.2. Only final effective repository changes are summarized, "
"excluding ReliefNT implementation, pure merges, and gitlink-only updates. The next range starts at"
" that version commit."
